From c1f99b2d9ff81177a27427272ed6fbda1a0580e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:36:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Battle banner: the French, German, Italian, Catalan and
 Japanese blocks follow the labels' own-size lettering

The banner's block table of each of these languages is what tools/localize/labels.py battle_banner draws (SYSTEM_W's stat letters for the Latin ones, font B for Japanese); the tables had kept the earlier squeezed lettering, so the publication gate could not reproduce them from the player's own files.
---
